WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:02.980
Hey youtubers it's Charlie!

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.529
I just hit 100,000 subscribers and Oh My God
What The Fuck!

00:00:06.529 --> 00:00:09.010
I just wanted to make a video to thank all
you guys for being so awesome.

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.510
I though about drinking 100 beers in your
honor,

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.690
but then promptly slapped myself.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:16.760
Maybe just ordering some takeout and watching
some Arrow would be more appropriate.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.800
Almost a year ago I started making videos
to find other people to talk about all my

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.800
favorite things with.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.050
And as you can see, it's gotten a little out
of hand.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:24.369
In the best possible way.

00:00:24.369 --> 00:00:26.080
Seriously, you should see my coffee bill though.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.080
It's pretty bad.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:30.230
So while I may have turned into a bit of a
vampire, this has changed my life in the best

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.230
possible way.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.899
And I have all you guys to thank for it.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:36.390
When people ask me how to become a Youtuber,
I just say talk about things that you're really

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.670
passionate about.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.500
Find other people that also enjoy those things
and then if there's something that they're

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.730
really passionate about, that they want to
talk about,

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:43.990
Make a video about it and Boom!

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:45.260
You're a Youtuber!

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.930
Whether you're a new subscriber or you drank
the Kool-Aide a long time ago.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.990
You may have noticed that things change week
to week.

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:52.750
That's just me listening to your feedback
trying to make things better.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:56.950
That's where things like, The Weekly Sherlock
and all the Ask Emergency Q&amp;A videos and Anime

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:57.950
Club come from.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.850
The next big thing I'm working on is Movie
Night.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.241
The funny thing being that movie night is
technically every night.

00:01:02.241 --> 00:01:04.280
Even though that video will only post once
a week.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:05.900
So thus, Movie Night is born!

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:09.540
A lot of you guys have been asking for video
game videos, book reviews and lots of other

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:10.540
things too.

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:12.590
I love getting your suggestions, thank you
so much.

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:13.950
Please keep sending them to me.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:17.560
Generally I don't have regrets, but I am sorry
I can't answer everyone's comments all the

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:18.560
time.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.880
I do read everything though.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:23.690
But I have cranked up the language filters
just a little bit on my comments, just to

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:25.979
reduce the f-bomb related deaths on the channel.

00:01:25.979 --> 00:01:28.200
So if you make a comment and you don't see
it on a video.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.200
Don't worry, I still see it on the back-end.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.990
I really hope you guys have been enjoying
the giveaways I've been doing lately as part

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:33.990
of Anime Club

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.890
and the upcoming Weekly Giveaway that I'm
going to do as part of Walking Dead.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.590
I might change it up a little bit, I like
doing giveaways more than I like doing contests.

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:43.440
Because it's really just a way for me to give
back to you guys.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:46.050
A lot of you guys have been asking about T-Shirts
and other swag.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:49.549
I don't have anything planned yet, but I am
working on some new Channel Art.

00:01:49.549 --> 00:01:51.190
You know, making things a little bit shinyer.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:53.810
So once that happens, I might think about
making T-Shirts.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:56.980
I have been getting some questions about local
meetups and In Real Life events.

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:58.381
I'm really excited to do stuff like that.

00:01:58.381 --> 00:01:59.479
I'm not quite ready yet though.

00:01:59.479 --> 00:02:02.080
I'm in the middle of moving Baker Street to
a new location.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.810
I'm looking for a new apartment right now.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:04.810
So maybe after that.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:07.740
But I will be at Vidcon this summer giving
away free stuff.

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:09.679
Thank You so much you guys for being so awesome!

00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:12.840
I never though this would happen, but I am
so glad that it did!

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:16.340
I am making a Channel Update video later this
week, maybe Thurs or Fri.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:17.340
So look out for that.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:20.810
That will explain what my upload schedule
will be through Feb and March, just because

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:21.810
Walking Dead is coming back

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:23.650
and Hannibal Season 2 is coming up.

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:27.670
Right now click here to see my reactions to
Peter Capaldi's new Doctor Who Costume.

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:29.560
Tumblr had a lot of fun with that one.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.599
And click here to get my Series 8 Predictions.

00:02:31.599 --> 00:02:34.280
Thank you so much for watching you guys, now
everybody Group High Five!

